{"items": [
{"description": "Large pale green melon cubes (honeydew or cantaloupe-like), pale green-white flesh with slight translucence, cut into about 4 chunky cubes roughly 2-3 cm each, sitting at the top-left of the plate with low height (about 1.5-2 cm), moist surface with no sheen.", "candidates": ["honeydew melon", "cantaloupe", "cucumber"], "grams": 70},
{"description": "Fresh dark green spinach or leafy greens, crinkled and glossy-matte leaves with some stems, covering roughly a quarter of the plate in a loose pile about 1-2 cm high, moist, no dressing sheen visible.", "candidates": ["raw baby spinach", "mixed salad greens", "kale"], "grams": 60},
{"description": "Thin orange shredded strips, bright orange with slightly wet surface, scattered over the greens, very small amount.", "candidates": ["shredded carrot", "julienned sweet potato", "shredded butternut squash"], "grams": 10},
{"description": "Whole small red cherry tomatoes, glossy skin, about 2 cm diameter, two pieces on the left side of the greens.", "candidates": ["cherry tomato", "red grape tomato", "red bell pepper cube"], "grams": 25},
{"description": "Halved and whole strawberries, bright red glossy surface with white-tinged tops, about 5-6 pieces of moderate size clustered on right side, around 2-3 cm each.", "candidates": ["strawberry", "raspberry", "red watermelon cube"], "grams": 75},
{"description": "Small dark blueberries, deep blue-purple with matte bloom, around 15-18 berries scattered in a cluster on the upper right of the plate.", "candidates": ["blueberry", "blackberry", "blackcurrant"], "grams": 30},
{"description": "Pale yellow-green melon cubes, similar to the other melon, two pieces on the right side near the blueberries, about 2 cm, slightly moist.", "candidates": ["honeydew melon", "cantaloupe", "pear chunk"], "grams": 25}
]}
